{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "go_park_00_01",
      "hash": "7fbbaaedc1e6df95",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "歡迎來到GO Park！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "go_park_00_02",
      "hash": "7fbba7edc1e6da7c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "想聽哪部分的說明呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "go_park_00_03",
      "hash": "7fbba8edc1e6dc2f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "您有什麼需要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "go_park_00_10",
      "hash": "7fbf2fedc1e9f76b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "帶寶可夢來"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "go_park_00_11",
      "hash": "7fbf2eedc1e9f5b8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GO Park"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "go_park_00_12",
      "hash": "7fbf31edc1e9fad1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "遊樂區"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "go_park_00_13",
      "hash": "7fbf30edc1e9f91e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "聽說明"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "go_park_00_14",
      "hash": "7fbf33edc1e9fe37",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "退出"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "go_park_00_15",
      "hash": "7fbf32edc1e9fc84",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "關於帶寶可夢來"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "go_park_00_16",
      "hash": "7fbf35edc1ea019d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "關於GO Park"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "go_park_00_17",
      "hash": "7fbf34edc1e9ffea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "關於遊樂區"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "go_park_00_20",
      "hash": "7fb51dedc1e18450",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "您可以把Pokémon GO裡的\\n寶可夢帶到GO Park。\\c\\n首先，在Ｘ選單的「設定」中\\n選擇「與Pokémon GO連線」，\\r\\n與Pokémon GO進行配對。\\c\\n然後，請在Pokémon GO中\\n選擇想要傳送的寶可夢。\\c\\n寶可夢一旦傳送至GO Park，\\n將無法返回Pokémon GO，\\r\\n敬請注意。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "go_park_00_21",
      "hash": "7fb51eedc1e18603",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "從Pokémon GO\\n帶來的寶可夢\\r\\n會在GO Park裡面玩。\\c\\n和寶可夢說話，\\n就可以進行捕捉，\\r\\n或是把牠們移到別的GO Park。\\c\\n捉到的寶可夢\\n將無法返回GO Park。\\c\\n要離開GO Park時，\\n請按Ｘ鍵。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "go_park_00_22",
      "hash": "7fb51fedc1e187b6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只要有25隻相同種類的\\n寶可夢在GO Park裡，\\r\\n就可以去遊樂區玩。\\c\\n帶領寶可夢們\\n往位於上方的終點前進吧！\\c\\n只要在限制時間內\\n把所有的寶可夢\\r\\n都帶到終點就算過關！\\c\\n要小心從地面出現的\\n搗蛋寶可夢！\\c\\n如果想中途退出遊戲，\\n請按Ｘ鍵。"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "go_park_01_01",
      "hash": "d5055ee3b2da9820",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GO Park １"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "go_park_01_02",
      "hash": "d50561e3b2da9d39",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GO Park ２"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "go_park_01_03",
      "hash": "d50560e3b2da9b86",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GO Park ３"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "go_park_01_04",
      "hash": "d50563e3b2daa09f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GO Park ４"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "go_park_01_05",
      "hash": "d50562e3b2da9eec",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GO Park ５"
    },
    {
